-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">[단. 4학년은 미이수시 졸업 불가함으로 선발에서 제외함]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccccff; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 신청 장소 : 그린에너지융합센터 행정실 (그린에너지관 405호)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 신청 방법 : 신청서 + 성적증명서 제출 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;[ 부득이한 경우 신청서(원본 스캔) 를 메일로 제출 +성적표 별도송부 ]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 선발 확정 예정일 :&nbsp; 2013.09.02(월)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '새굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">6. 세부사항 : 붙임 파일 참조</span></p><p class=\"H